    "\u001bP+q544f\u001b\\dcs tail",
    "\u001b(B\u001b[Mnf sequence",
    "\u001bKfe single byte",
    "mixed \u001b[2Jclear and text",
    " unterminated \u001b[31m",
    "\u001b[38;2;255;128;0mtruecolor\u001b[0m",
    "tab\tkept\nnewline kept"
  ],
  "notes": "ANSI strip state machine (lib/libansi/ansi_strip.c vs LIVE tools/ansi_strip.py): fast-path detection, CSI (params/intermediates/private-mode), OSC BEL+ST, DCS, nF/Fp/Fe single-byte, unterminated sequences, passthrough of tabs/newlines."
